#: ../../repository.rst:1
msgid "Guidedog"
msgstr "Guidedog"

#: ../../repository.rst:4
msgid "**Write once. Explain well. Publish on the web and on paper.**"
msgstr ""
"**Escriba una vez. Explique con claridad. Publique en la web y en papel.**"

#: ../../repository.rst:6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Guidedog builds HTML documentation sites and PDF books from "
#| "reStructuredText and Markdown. It is written in Odin. Its conversion "
#| "engine is **Guidedoc**, and Typst typesets the PDF pages. No Python "
#| "environment or LaTeX installation is needed."
msgid ""
"Guidedog builds HTML documentation sites and PDF books from "
"reStructuredText and Markdown. It is written in Rust. Its conversion "
"engine is **Guidedoc**, and the embedded Typst compiler typesets the PDF "
"pages. No Python environment or LaTeX installation is needed."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog genera sitios de documentación HTML y libros PDF a partir de "
"reStructuredText y Markdown. Está escrito en Odin. El motor de conversión "
"se llama **Guidedoc** y Typst compone las páginas PDF. No requiere Python "
"ni LaTeX."

#: ../../repository.rst:10
msgid ""
"Sphinx inspires the authoring workflow. Guidedog is an independent "
"system: configuration is declarative TOML, API extraction is static, and "
"Python configuration and extensions are never executed. Complete Sphinx "
"compatibility is not a goal."
msgstr ""
"El flujo de escritura se inspira en Sphinx, pero Guidedog es un sistema "
"independiente. Usa TOML declarativo y extracción estática de API. Nunca "
"ejecuta configuración ni extensiones Python. No pretende ser "
"completamente compatible con Sphinx."

