msgid ""
"This page is the repository overview. On GitHub, the ``README`` files at "
"the root of the repository give the same overview in each language of the "
"manual."
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:17
msgid "Start a project"
msgstr "Crear un proyecto"

#: ../../repository.rst:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The project contains `conf.toml`, `index.rst`, "
#| "`_templates/layout.html`, `_templates/book.typ`, and `_static/`. "
#| "Templates are ordinary files you can edit. HTML provides navigation, "
#| "search, code highlighting, diagrams, and equations. PDF books provide "
#| "chapters, cross-references, figures, indexes, and language-aware "
#| "typesetting."
msgid ""
"The project contains ``conf.toml``, ``index.rst``, "
"``_templates/layout.html``, ``_templates/book.typ``, and ``_static/``. "
"Templates are ordinary files we can edit. HTML provides navigation, "
"search, code highlighting, diagrams, and equations. PDF books provide "
"chapters, cross-references, figures, indexes, and language-aware "
"typesetting."
msgstr ""
"El proyecto contiene `conf.toml`, `index.rst`, `_templates/layout.html`, "
"`_templates/book.typ` y `_static/`. Las plantillas son archivos "
"editables. HTML ofrece navegación, búsqueda, código resaltado, diagramas "
"y ecuaciones. PDF ofrece capítulos, referencias, figuras, índices y "
"composición adaptada al idioma."

#: ../../repository.rst:32
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The default theme is light. Readers can choose dark or the system "
#| "theme. The manual detects the browser language on its landing page and "
#| "repository overview. A saved choice takes precedence; direct links to "
#| "an edition or chapter remain explicit requests."
msgid ""
"The default theme is light. Readers can choose dark or the system theme. "
"The manual detects the browser language on its landing page and "
"repository overview. A saved choice takes precedence. Direct links to an "
"edition or chapter remain explicit requests."
msgstr ""
"El tema predeterminado es claro; también puede elegir oscuro o el del "
"sistema. La portada del manual y el resumen del repositorio detectan el "
"idioma del navegador. La elección guardada tiene prioridad y se respetan "
"los enlaces directos a una edición o capítulo."

